# Selenium Java BDD Automation Framework

This project is a sample **Selenium Automation Framework** built using **Java, Cucumber BDD, and Gradle**.
It demonstrates a scalable test automation architecture using **Page Object Model (POM)** and modern automation practices.

---

## Tech Stack

* Java
* Selenium WebDriver
* Cucumber BDD
* Gradle
* Page Object Model (POM)
* Log4j2 Logging
* Extent Reports
* WebDriverManager

---

## Framework Features

• Page Object Model design pattern
• BasePage reusable Selenium utilities
• ThreadLocal WebDriver for parallel execution
• Hooks for setup and teardown
• Screenshot capture on test failure
• Extent HTML reporting
• Log4j2 logging implementation
• Tag based test execution
• Scenario Outline for data-driven testing
• Configuration using properties file

